$b = 50;
Context("Point");
$yi = Point("(0,50)");

######
# Body
######

BEGIN_PGML
What was the value of [`b`] in the plot of Yara's savings?

[_]{$b}{5}

What is the [`y`]-intercept?

[_]{$yi}{5}

END_PGML

##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
The line crosses the [`y`]-axis at [`(0,50)\text{,}`] so the value of [`b`] is [`50\text{.}`] And the [`y`]-intercept is [`(0,50)\text{.}`]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

